cap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><circle cx="18" cy="50" r="4" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="8" y="38" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">A</text><line x1="222" y1="50" x2="200" y2="50" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><circle cx="222" cy="50" r="4" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="232" y="38" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">B</text></svg>', 'Between A and B: an unknown capacitor X in series with a 6.0 µF capacitor, with a 2.0 µF capacitor in parallel with the pair; the combined capacitance is 5.0 µF.'),
('b895705c-2edf-5449-8ba7-bbfc87542cfd', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', 'c4c09cba-9d0a-4033-abe7-0b8c56bb7ef4', 'a-level', '23.6', '9702 coursebook 23.6 · Capacitor networks', 29, 29, 'A 3.0 µF capacitor is in series with a parallel pair of two 3.0 µF capacitors, across 12 V. Calculate the energy stored in the single 3.0 µF capacitor, in µJ.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '96 uJ', 'µJ', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Parallel pair 6.0 µF; total C = 3.0 × 6.0 ÷ 9.0 = 2.0 µF; Q = 2.0 × 10⁻⁶ × 12 = 2.4 × 10⁻⁵ C. W = Q²/2C = (2.4 × 10⁻⁵)² ÷ (2 × 3.0 × 10⁻⁶) = 9.6 × 10⁻⁵ J. In µJ: 9.6 × 10⁻⁵ × 10⁶ = 96. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: total C. C1: same Q on series capacitor. C1: W = Q²/2C. A1: W = 96 µJ.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 300 236" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgb04ebebe-t fgb04ebebe-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgb04ebebe-t">Capacitor network</title><desc id="fgb04ebebe-d">A 3.0 µF capacitor in series with two 3.0 µF capacitors in parallel, across 12 V.</desc><line x1="26" y1="48" x2="75" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="85" y1="48" x2="134" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="75" y1="36" x2="75" y2="60" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="85" y1="36" x2="85" y2="60" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="80" y="24" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3.0 µF</text><line x1="134" y1="48" x2="150" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="258" y1="48" x2="274" y2="48" style="stroke:curre