('cd4008b5-fb65-5cef-9b51-61a1be924eb0', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', 'c4c09cba-9d0a-4033-abe7-0b8c56bb7ef4', 'a-level', '23.6', '9702 coursebook 23.6 · Capacitor networks', 31, 31, 'Using a 1.0 µF, a 2.0 µF and a 3.0 µF capacitor, all three must be used. Calculate the smallest combined capacitance possible, in µF.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.5455', 'µF', false, NULL, false, ARRAY['5.455e-7']::text[], 'All in series: C = 1 ÷ (1/1.0 + 1/2.0 + 1/3.0) = 0.545 µF. Mark scheme (3 marks). M1: all in series gives the smallest. C1: reciprocal sum. A1: C = 0.545 µF.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('35e8b4de-1407-5c2c-9dfc-f85004f588f1', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', 'c4c09cba-9d0a-4033-abe7-0b8c56bb7ef4', 'a-level', '23.6', '9702 coursebook 23.6 · Capacitor networks', 32, 32, 'Two 10 µF capacitors in series are connected in parallel with another two 10 µF capacitors in series, and the network is connected across 20 V. Calculate the total energy stored, in mJ.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2 mJ', 'mJ', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Each branch 5.0 µF; total 10 µF. W = 0.5 × 10 × 10⁻⁶ × 20² = 2.0 × 10⁻³ J. In mJ: 2.0 × 10⁻³ × 1000 = 2.0. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: total C = 10 µF. C1: W = ½CV². A1: W = 2.0 mJ.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 300 236" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg31fbb5c1-t fg31fbb5c1-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg31fbb5c1-t">Capacitor network</title><desc id="fg31fbb5c1-d">Two series pairs of 10 µF capacitors connected in parallel across 20 V.</desc><line x1="26" y1="48" x2="42" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="258" y1="48" x2="274" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="42" y1="48" x2="42" y2="102" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="258" y1="48" x2="258" y2="102" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="42" y1="48" x2="91" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="101" y1="48" x2="150" y2="48" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="91" y1="36" x2="91" y2="60" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejo