('7d5c4d9f-a93a-5b04-a5f8-6513fdb1ab8e', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', '0c42a207-4bd1-5379-b11d-d983544be962', 'a-level', '23.7', '9702 coursebook 23.7 · Discharging a capacitor', 23, 23, 'The capacitance in a discharge circuit is doubled and the resistance is halved. What happens to the time constant?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'It stays the same', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'τ = RC, and doubling C while halving R leaves the product unchanged. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: τ = RC. C1: product unchanged. A1: B (It stays the same).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('a20ac572-5c0b-57cc-bb3e-79e6f8580920', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', '0c42a207-4bd1-5379-b11d-d983544be962', 'a-level', '23.7', '9702 coursebook 23.7 · Discharging a capacitor', 24, 24, 'The initial discharge current of a capacitor is 2.0 mA and the time constant is 4.0 s. Calculate the current after 5.0 s, in mA.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.573 mA', 'mA', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'I = I₀e^(−t/RC) = 2.0 × e^(−5.0/4.0) = 0.573 mA. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: I = I₀e^(−t/RC). C1: substitution. A1: I = 0.573 mA.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fga4eabb7a-t fga4eabb7a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fga4eabb7a-t">Discharge current</title><desc id="fga4eabb7a-d">Graph of discharge current against time: it falls exponentially from 2.0 mA with a time constant of 4.0 s. A dashed line marks t = 5.0 s.</desc><line x1="33" y1="34" x2="33" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="142.1" y1="34" x2="142.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="251.1" y1="34" x2="251.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="360.2" y1="34" x2="360.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="195.6" x2="382" y2="195.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="33" y1="149.1" x2="382" y2="149.1" style="stroke:var(--fig-g