</svg>', 'Graph of p.d. against time for a 470 µF capacitor discharging from 12 V through 1.0 kΩ (time constant 0.47 s).'),
('166a13bd-6dc3-5aaf-afc0-02d2d4c6bb18', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', '0c42a207-4bd1-5379-b11d-d983544be962', 'a-level', '23.7', '9702 coursebook 23.7 · Discharging a capacitor', 48, 48, '(a) Show that the product RC has the unit of seconds. (b) A discharging capacitor has RC = 2.0 s. Calculate the time taken for its p.d. to fall by 20 %. (c) Calculate the fraction of the initial energy remaining at that time. Give only the answer to (b).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.4463', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Ω × F = (V A⁻¹)(C V⁻¹) = C A⁻¹ = (A s) A⁻¹ = s. (b) V = 0.80V₀, so t = RC ln(1/0.80) = 2.0 × ln 1.25 = 0.446 s. (c) W ∝ V², so the fraction = 0.80² = 0.64. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: units shown. M1: V/V₀ = 0.80. C1: t = RC ln(1/0.80). C1: energy fraction 0.64. A1: t = 0.446 s.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('b1d27b6f-44e1-5c8d-8a55-388dd9a70769', '34322ed1-8148-406d-97ee-947a4eca6b7f', '0c42a207-4bd1-5379-b11d-d983544be962', 'a-level', '23.7', '9702 coursebook 23.7 · Discharging a capacitor', 49, 49, 'A student measures the time t½ for the p.d. across a capacitor to fall from 10 V to 5.0 V using different resistors: R/kΩ = 10, 20, 30, 40 and t½/s = 0.70, 1.38, 2.08, 2.77. (a) Explain why a graph of t½ against R is a straight line through the origin. (b) Calculate the gradient using the first and last readings. (c) Calculate the capacitance, in µF. Give only the answer to (c).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '99.55', 'µF', false, NULL, false, ARRAY['9.955e-5']::text[], '(a) t½ = RC ln 2, so t½ ∝ R with gradient C ln 2. (b) Gradient = (2.77 − 0.70) ÷ ((40 − 10) × 10³) = 6.90 × 10⁻⁵ s Ω⁻¹. (c) C = gradient ÷ ln 2 = 6.900 × 10⁻⁵ ÷ ln 2 = 9.95 × 10⁻⁵ F. In µF: 9.955 × 10⁻⁵ × 10⁶ = 99.5. Mark scheme (6 marks). M1: t½ = RC ln 2. B1: proportional to R. C1: gradient. C1: C = gradient/ln 2. C1: conversion to µF. A1: C = 99.5 µF.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 410" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgefd73472-t fgefd73472-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgefd73472-t">Half-time against resistance</title><desc id="fgefd73472-d">Table and graph of the time for the p.d. to halve against resistance: R = 10, 20, 30, 40 kΩ give t½ = 0.70, 1.38, 2.08, 2.77 s, a straight line through the origin.</desc><g transform="translate(0,0)"><rect x="133.5" y="8" width="133" height="140" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><rect x="133.5" y="8" width="133" height="28" rx="0" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="168.1" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">R / kΩ</text><text x="234.6" y="22" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">t½ / s</text><line x1="202.7" y1="8" x2="202.7" y2="148" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="133.5" y1="36" x2="266.5" y2="36" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="168.1" y="50" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">10</text><text x="234.6" y="50" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.70</text><line x1="133.5" y1="64" x2="266.5" y2="64" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="168.1" y="78" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">20</text><text x="234.6" y="78" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">1.38</text><line x1="133.5" y1="92" x2="266.5" y2="92" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="168.1" y="106" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">30</text><text x="234.6" y="106" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2.08</text><line x1="133.5" y1="120" x2="266.5" y2="120" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="168.1" y="134" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">40</text><text x="234.6" y="134" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">2.77</text></g><g transform="translate(0,160)"><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="202" style="stroke:var(--fig